{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本8人男團ONE OR EIGHT，2024年憑OneRepublic主音Ryan Tedder製作歌曲《Don't Tell Nobody》出道後，最近憑為正播中動畫《黑色四葉草》演唱第2季片尾曲《Yellow Brick Road》人氣急升。</p><p>組合宣布將明年1月22日假新蒲崗PORTAL舉行《ONE OR EIGHT Special Show Case 2026-2027 in Asia -V8-》香港演唱會，亦是他們自2024年後，重臨香港會歌迷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:41:03.155892+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T16:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:27:15.763862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:38:20.928326+00:00","content_hash":"cadd904de467e7670fab1defb8102cb96409e06b34e937d482704cd6bf068685","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:41:03.155892+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}